
>> shop := (Diksyonaryo bag-o
	ibutang: ['magazine'] sa: ['books'],
	ibutang: ['computer'] sa: ['electronics'],
	ibutang: ['lipstick'] sa: ['cosmetics']
).
Gawas isulat: (shop adunay: ['computer']), bag-ong-linya. 
Gawas isulat: (shop adunay: ['sausage']), bag-ong-linya. 
Gawas isulat: (shop adunay: ['computers']), bag-ong-linya. 
Gawas isulat: (shop adunay: ['compute']), bag-ong-linya. 
Gawas isulat: (shop adunay: ['2computer']), bag-ong-linya. 
